{"title":"2007 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At Euclid High School, the number of students taking the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10\" title=\"AMC 10\">AMC 10</a> was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> in 2002, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/4/2d40f3652c1962e98ce050a88c04ed37997c67df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$66$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> in 2003, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa94edfb9739dcc66dad90f7dd5c148f44a57e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> in 2004, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/5/1d5db6ea360f9b1367e4db85c18474906401e2c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$76$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> in 2005, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/d/76d15d808807bfa561e72dc8111649ed0a204ebe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$78$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and 2006, and is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/e/7fea07b9bf739f8e420081f31186264b91ced2ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$85$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> in 2007. Between what two consecutive years was there the largest percentage increase?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/4/c540813196397eaf04ed89dae18091ec338fdb91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 2002\\ \\text{and}\\ 2003 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 2003\\ \\text{and}\\ 2004 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 2004\\ \\text{and}\\ 2005 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 2005\\ \\text{and}\\ 2006 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 2006\\ \\text{and}\\ 2007$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"837\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We compute the percentage increases:\n</p>\n<ol><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/9/389e5ba4a88996c159c1963346c7a98af4590040.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{66 - 60}{60} = 10\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"119\" height=\"37\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/2/5f26a79b31be5df93c7f405ebe62ce0d8dad2ccf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{70 - 66}{66} \\approx 6\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"110\" height=\"37\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/5/0f55735d70f0b2afeb9ca709e0ee8c610f7375f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{76-70}{70} \\approx 8.6\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"124\" height=\"37\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/f/d1fe473b8ca10c03899105f334f56489d34a531b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{78-76}{76} \\approx 2.6\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"124\" height=\"37\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c30c6fe0cb92105bdf1d6ae6179d67c621ea070.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{85-78}{78} \\approx 9\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"110\" height=\"37\" /></li></ol>\n<p>The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/2/ca2f4283cfd441270cb90bfd2cf89a533f3dde81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p>In fact, the answer follows directly from examining the differences between each year. The largest differences are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Due to the decreased starting number of students between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/e/96e470b7ce7a2f4d0c1ae064d2874ca377693897.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2002$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/1/b910f4dafca80b54c6e7bedf63b6485eebff0764.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2003$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />, that interval will be our answer.\n</p><p>Note: After we find the initial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />% difference to be our largest percent, we can increase each previous number by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />% and estimate whether that number is larger than the difference between the two numbers. \n~Thyauraisoverwhelming\n</p><p>~edited by mobius247\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We make the numerator 1 and compare the denominators.\n</p>\n<ol><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/b/6cb096eceeb6d8d93055ba2059444d7532663f59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{66 - 60}{60} = \\frac{1}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"111\" height=\"38\" /></li></ol>\n<ol><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/9/92941ea7f2f3be74e815402ba2510739d47ebaf9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{70 - 66}{66} = \\frac{1}{16.5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"125\" height=\"38\" /></li></ol>\n<ol><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/0/8301fb04a8536a6a1474d88ead9a1fa8d4547cd6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{76-70}{70} \\approx \\frac{1}{11.7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"125\" height=\"38\" /></li></ol>\n<ol><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/a/d7ab3000f376a6f62b300201ab256579acedee24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{78-76}{76} = \\frac{1}{38}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"111\" height=\"38\" /></li></ol>\n<ol><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/5/975cb90f73aa473ef2ac1f2187bf8e39c1c937c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{85-78}{78} \\approx \\frac{1}{11.1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"125\" height=\"38\" /></li></ol>\n<p><br />\nThe answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/2/ca2f4283cfd441270cb90bfd2cf89a533f3dde81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>~thatmathsguy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A\" title=\"2007 AMC 10A\">2007 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Proble